# Factory enable policy — Phase 2 additions (FID-2026-0912-002).
#
# Phase 1 entries live in 90-savantos-factory.preset; this file carries
# the display-manager layer. sddm ships [Install] WantedBy=graphical.target,
# so preset creates the wants symlink; display-manager.service alias
# creation is enforced separately in finalize.sh (idempotent, survives
# preset-all either way — R3 in the FID).

enable sddm.service
